    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>A scientific and technical illustrator Embraced in 1997 after two separate unnerving encounters with @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} vampires \u2014 one of whom spared her out of admiration for her art \u2014 left her disillusioned with science and drawn to surrealist and horrific subject matter. The Black Eagles recruited her for her artistic talent.</p><p>See Richard B. Weinstein's entry for the pack's shared background as Black Eagle Consulting, Inc.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Katherine is the newest and most conventionally human-seeming of the pack, still processing her transformation through her art. She is observant and curious rather than jaded.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed):</strong> Dominate 2, Obtenebration 1, Potence 1.</p>",
